					-- Vertical-teleport variant of sendFaceMouse: sets the aim-stance env flag and ALWAYS fires the "faceMouse" remote
					-- directly (no FaceMouseModuleWorks check, no de-dup by fireAimStanceRemote), recording the state and send time.
